          <attvalue for="34" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Rising war-risk and route-specific insurance premiums raise import and transportation costs for governments and regulators, prompting quicker deployment of interventions such as subsidies, state shipping support, or emergency procurement to stabilize markets." />
