          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.55" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A spike in shipping war‑risk and route-specific insurance raises trade and earnings uncertainty, triggering risk‑off reallocations that produce net portfolio inflows into safe‑haven sovereign bonds." />
