          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Broader sanctions on finance, shipping, insurance and servicing of energy firms directly constrain the ability to load, insure and deliver LNG cargoes from affected suppliers, reducing traded flow volumes." />
